{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39879","headline":"东归出城留别知己 · 徐夤","name":"东归出城留别知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韦蒙屈指许非才，三载长安共酒桮。\n欲别未攀杨柳赠，相留拟待牡丹开。\n寒随御水波光散，暖逐衡阳雁影来。\n他日因书问衰飒，东溪须访子陵台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}